      "text": "Bengaluru traffic advisory: Due to concreting work by SWR near Kempegowda Underpass on Kasturi Nagar Outer Ring Road, all vehicular movement is prohibited for 10 days from March 13. Vehicles from Ramamurthy Nagar & Sadanandanagar towards Vijayapura are restricted. Alternative routes: via Ramamurthy Nagar Main Road/FCl Road or Kasturi Nagar 2nd Cross. Parking is prohibited on Kasturi Nagar Outer Ring Road @blrcitytraffic",
